{"title":"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(THINKING_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (THINKING CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Four students take an exam. Three of their scores are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a9eb790525ec61800794ed42014fbac4579694.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70, 80,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. If the average of their four scores is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, then what is the remaining score?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43b268204afb3efbc2ab31ea27821903837121e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }40\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }50\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }55\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }60\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the remaining student's score.  We know that the average, 70, is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/3/033d1e208892c0f6d1e1075a8bdeaa16ec99fc22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{70 + 80 + 90 + r}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"38\" />.  We can use basic algebra to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/4/f6415bdf4f17abab730096d189e087248be16df0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{70 + 80 + 90 + r}{4} = 70\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/872a61211590971bc10753d0b06a09429d6b659f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{240 + r}{4} = 70\\]\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/c/d9c40d53447be6e76479604c4397300d6f031ba6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[240 + r = 280\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa81b049ae1aead94bf9e9360c38d1c9da0f084.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r = 40\\]\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" /> giving us the answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53e3153168cac92604c90460e04877a9de63f052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to be the average, the other number must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53e3153168cac92604c90460e04877a9de63f052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>== Video Solution\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/R2jD3a5SXAY?si=brG-V2T2JYRkh_qC\">https://youtu.be/R2jD3a5SXAY?si=brG-V2T2JYRkh_qC</a>\nA solution so simple a 12-year-old made it!\n~Elijahman~\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/R2jD3a5SXAY?si=q-T8ZTrHYIb7j-xB\">https://youtu.be/R2jD3a5SXAY?si=q-T8ZTrHYIb7j-xB</a>\n</p><p>A solution so simple a 12-year-old made it!\n</p><p>~Elijahman~\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28THINKING_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(THINKING_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (THINKING CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (THINKING CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jRPgMzBXYLc\">https://youtu.be/jRPgMzBXYLc</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EuAzkusSbpY\">https://youtu.be/EuAzkusSbpY</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/51K3uCzntWs?t=772\">https://youtu.be/51K3uCzntWs?t=772</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8\" title=\"2016 AMC 8\">2016 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2016\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems/